{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to MeadowMeld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy colony sim about hybrid animals, heartwarming choices, and the memories you make along the way. Breed, build, and nurture a village where every creature matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004710/extras/84a96cbb2b13e983c83cb109efad48b7.avif?t=1760050292\" alt=\"MeadowMeld Breeding\" width=1560 height=378 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breed and Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine animals to create charming, never-before-seen hybrids - each with unique traits, appearances, and abilities that pass down to future generations. Will you raise a bee-cat, a donkey-eagle-sheep-peacock, or something entirely new?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004710/extras/aafe82cab0d1068b5c93055af9df47fb.avif?t=1760050292\" alt=\"MeadowMeld Lumber Mill\" width=1300 height=406 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Optimize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign workers, plan building placement, and master adjacency bonuses. Every tile and trait can turn the tide for your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004710/extras/abb652e6151eaf09e922e933e42455c2.avif?t=1760050292\" alt=\"MeadowMeld Relationships\" width=910 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nurture Relationships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the bonds between your animals with MeadowMeld\u2019s unique Heart, Mind, and Soul systems. Foster friendships, resolve rivalries, and watch your colony come alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape Your Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make - who to breed, which path to follow, how you honor your loved ones - leaves a legacy. Celebrate, remember, and create your own tale with every playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Behind the Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is still early in development - what you\u2019re seeing now is mostly the animal breeding system, which is the foundation of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But MeadowMeld isn\u2019t just about cute hybrids - it\u2019s about building something meaningful with them. Over time, you\u2019ll guide your animal villagers through resource decisions, cozy village life, emotional quests, and hard choices about who stays, who goes, and what kind of leader you want to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now to be notified when demo builds and the full release are available.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4004710?t=1760050292","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004710/6fbf1b92c1c2c8fc957ec3ad88b3737d0483eefa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760050292","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004710/7f4a1fdf17217bea46158ce072ec37c9be815132/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760050292","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004710/7f4a1fdf17217bea46158ce072ec37c9be815132/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760050292","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to MeadowMeld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy colony sim about hybrid animals, heartwarming choices, and the memories you make along the way. Breed, build, and nurture a village where every creature matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004710/extras/84a96cbb2b13e983c83cb109efad48b7.avif?t=1760050292\" alt=\"MeadowMeld Breeding\" width=1560 height=378 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Breed and Discover</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine animals to create charming, never-before-seen hybrids - each with unique traits, appearances, and abilities that pass down to future generations. Will you raise a bee-cat, a donkey-eagle-sheep-peacock, or something entirely new?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004710/extras/aafe82cab0d1068b5c93055af9df47fb.avif?t=1760050292\" alt=\"MeadowMeld Lumber Mill\" width=1300 height=406 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build and Optimize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign workers, plan building placement, and master adjacency bonuses. Every tile and trait can turn the tide for your village.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004710/extras/abb652e6151eaf09e922e933e42455c2.avif?t=1760050292\" alt=\"MeadowMeld Relationships\" width=910 height=340 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Nurture Relationships</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the bonds between your animals with MeadowMeld\u2019s unique Heart, Mind, and Soul systems. Foster friendships, resolve rivalries, and watch your colony come alive.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Shape Your Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice you make - who to breed, which path to follow, how you honor your loved ones - leaves a legacy. Celebrate, remember, and create your own tale with every playthrough.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Behind the Scenes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is still early in development - what you\u2019re seeing now is mostly the animal breeding system, which is the foundation of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But MeadowMeld isn\u2019t just about cute hybrids - it\u2019s about building something meaningful with them. Over time, you\u2019ll guide your animal villagers through resource decisions, cozy village life, emotional quests, and hard choices about who stays, who goes, and what kind of leader you want to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now to be notified when demo builds and the full release are available.</strong></p>","developers":["MeldFire"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4004710/0fec99c259799ae43deefc5dbc9506e4deedb5a7/header.jpg?t=1760050292","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4004710/417337667/cb77419ae1d43848ed88f424fc7c7fc247d399c7/1756807550/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757486054","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4004710/417337667/cb77419ae1d43848ed88f424fc7c7fc247d399c7/1756807550/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757486054","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4004710/417337667/cb77419ae1d43848ed88f424fc7c7fc247d399c7/1756807550/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757486054","id":257192106,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2